# Light on Painting — two night paintings (Vermeer, Hopper) relit in a single WebGPU fragment pass from baked depth/normal fields by a bulb hanging on a cord; drag the bulb (cord pays out/reels in, physics on the UI thread), swipe elsewhere to page between paintings, pinch to move the light in depth, double tap for a SwiftUI settings sheet.
# What this test covers: dragging the bulb down (cord pays out) and back up (reels in to its minimum), a sideways
# swing, paging to Nighthawks and rubber-banding past the last page, dragging the bulb over the second painting,
# pinching the light nearer/farther (clamped Z), a short page drag below the commit fraction (settles back), a
# slow committed drag back to the first painting, rubber-banding past the first page, and a fast swipe burst.
# Not covered: the settings sheet — its double tap needs two taps inside 320 ms, which agent-device's taps miss.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/light-on-painting"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait 3000
# Bulb starts at (201,336): drag it down-right, it swings back under the anchor.
gesture pan 201 336 80 150 800
wait 1500
# Reel it back up.
gesture pan 201 497 0 -200 800
wait 1500
# Sideways swing.
gesture pan 201 307 120 40 600
wait 1500
# Page to Nighthawks, then rubber-band past the last page.
swipe 330 620 60 620
wait 1500
swipe 330 620 60 620
wait 1500
# Drag the bulb across the second painting.
gesture pan 201 307 -120 120 900
wait 1500
# Pinch the light nearer and farther (Z clamped).
gesture pinch 0.5 201 600
wait 1000
gesture pinch 2 201 600
wait 1000
gesture pinch 3 201 600
wait 1000
# Short page drag (below the commit fraction): settles back.
gesture pan 150 650 60 0 900
wait 1500
# Slow committed drag back to the first painting, then rubber-band past it.
gesture pan 60 650 300 0 900
wait 1500
swipe 60 620 340 620
wait 1500
# Fast swipe burst between the pages.
swipe 330 620 60 620
wait 200
swipe 60 620 330 620
wait 200
swipe 330 620 60 620
wait 200
swipe 60 620 330 620
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
